### 8 cli query total
$ wtf query total --root <root> --now 2026-09-16T12:00:00-04:00
--- stdin
total := $600.50
exit 0
--- stdout
$600.50

### 9 cli q tasks | count --json
$ wtf q tasks | count --json
--- stdin
- [ ] pack
exit 0
--- stdout
[
  1
]

